## Final design

### A. Canonical Host identity (ji-host-core)

New file: `ji-java/applications/ji-host-core/src/main/java/io/github/diodeme/ji/host/HostIdentity.java`

```java
package io.github.diodeme.ji.host;

/**
 * Canonical Host identity (chapter 18 §4): the persisted {@code hostId} plus the revision that
 * guards concurrent renames. The id is the single source for every value derived from it
 * (Relay registration key, device authorization scope, artifact scope, UI routes).
 */
public record HostIdentity(String hostId, long revision) {
    /** Accepted ids are URL-safe because the id is a Relay management path segment. */
    public static final String FORMAT = "[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._-]{0,127}";
    ...
    public static HostIdentity validate(String hostId, long revision)
    public static String requireValid(String hostId)   // throws HostIdentityException
    public static String generate()  // SecureRandom
}
```

